                </paragraph>
              </item>
              <item>
                <paragraph>
                  Use the Limit Comparison Test to show that that the first series converges by comparing it to the second series.
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph>
                  <math display="block">$$\sum\limits_{n = 2}^{\infty}\frac{n}{n^{3} - 5}\qquad\sum\limits_{n = 2}^{\infty}\frac{1}{n^{2}}$$</math>
                </paragraph>
              </item>
            </list>
          </statement>
        </problem>
        <problem number="4">
          <statement>
            <list ordered="true">
